 <item rdf:about="https://www.dw.com/en/italy-hundreds-of-school-evacuated-after-bomb-threats/a-79918034?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-rdf">
  <title>Italy: Hundreds of school evacuated after bomb threats</title>
  <link>https://www.dw.com/en/italy-hundreds-of-school-evacuated-after-bomb-threats/a-79918034?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-rdf</link>
  <description>Although the government believes the threat to be a hoax, it has nevertheless prompted concerns about &quot;hybrid warfare&quot; in Europe. Similar messages were sent in Northern Ireland, Ireland, and Bulgaria.</description>
