<item rdf:about="https://www.dw.com/en/tundu-lissu-after-escaping-the-death-penalty-what-does-his-guilty-verdict-mean-for-tanzania-s-democracy/a-79908512?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-rdf">
  <title>Tundu Lissu: After escaping the death penalty, what does his guilty verdict mean for Tanzania&apos;s democracy?</title>
  <link>https://www.dw.com/en/tundu-lissu-after-escaping-the-death-penalty-what-does-his-guilty-verdict-mean-for-tanzania-s-democracy/a-79908512?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-rdf</link>
  <description>A treason trial could have meant death by hanging for Tanzanian opposition leader Tundu Lissu. Instead, he now faces four years in prison for incitement to unrest. Ban dissident voices truly be heard in the country?</description>
  <dc:date>2026-11-11T13:33:00Z</dc:date>
  <dc:subject>World</dc:subject>
  <dc:language>en</dc:language>
  <dwsyn:contentID>79908512</dwsyn:contentID>
 </item>
<item rdf:about="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-only-1-3-of-germans-satisfied-with-state-of-democracy/live-79915066?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-rdf">
  <title>Germany news: Only 1/3 of Germans satisfied with state of democracy</title>
  <link>https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-only-1-3-of-germans-satisfied-with-state-of-democracy/live-79915066?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-rdf</link>
  <description>A new authoritarianism study has revealed a new low in satisfaction levels with the functioning of German democracy. Meanwhile, the Bundeswehr has banned Chinese-made drones. DW has more.</description>
